### Project ignores
tmp/

# Worktree-discipline pack — installed from the livespec-dev-tooling package
# (the single canonical source) via `just install-worktree-pack` / bootstrap,
# NOT tracked here. The from-package installer writes byte-identical copies
# into dev-tooling/ at bootstrap, mirroring how the commit-refuse hooks are
# installed into the untracked .git/hooks/ dir. The pack is six payload files
# (plus a generated dev-tooling/.gitignore): the four executable shell scripts
# (`worktree-lib.sh`, `branch-protection.sh`, `gate-run.sh`, and the fy02
# workflow-edit guard `check-no-workflow-edits.sh`) plus the `worktree.just`
# and `branch-protection.just` recipe fragments the root justfile `import?`s.
# The per-ecosystem dev-tooling/worktree-hydrate.sh stub stays TRACKED (it is
# not part of the package pack).
/dev-tooling/worktree-lib.sh
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.sh
/dev-tooling/gate-run.sh
/dev-tooling/check-no-workflow-edits.sh
/dev-tooling/worktree.just
/dev-tooling/branch-protection.just
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
.claude/worktrees/
.codex
.idea/

# Playwright MCP browser-tool scratch (page snapshots, console logs) —
# per-session, never durable state.
.playwright-mcp/

